# aegis-6lwc: a tracked TEXT file silently classified as BINARY is UNDIFFABLE, so no edit to it is
# ever reviewable. That happened to a skill read by 14 clones and nobody noticed for weeks.
# Skills are read by many and reviewed by few — they must stay diffable from the first commit.
*.md   text diff
*.py   text diff
*.sh   text diff
*.toml text diff
*.json text diff
